 "headline": "<strong>\"Brad and puppies? Name a better day!\"</strong> <em>- </em><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/kaitkohl\"><em>kaitkohl</em></a>",
 "intro": "paramount hired IHC to help spread big dog adoption awareness for their new film <em>heart of the beast.</em>",
