   ],
   "html": "<p>Guests were invited to step into the world of <strong>Heart of the Beast </strong>through a meaningful, dog-first experience designed to bring people closer to the animals at the heart of the story. In partnership with <a href=\"https://www.wagsandwalks.org/\"><strong>Wags &amp; Walks</strong></a>, we threw an event for big dog awareness to educating guests about senior dog rescue, responsible big dog ownership, and the adult dog adoption process, while creating intentional time and space to interact with adoptable big (or soon to be!) dogs.</p>\n<p><strong>Brad Pitt </strong>made a special surprise appearance to promote the film and encourage dog adoption resulting in a memorable and impactful community experience.  </p>"
  }
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Decor & vibes",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>We took over Copperline Ranch, a 60-acre private destination, just outside Nashville. We decorated their barn deck with rustic, woodsy furniture and floral arrangements providing an authentic and earthy touch. Local fare of chicken sandwich bites, brisket meatballs, charcuterie, and sliders were available. Guests received a custom embroidered bandana and a treat for their pup back home.</p>"
    },
