  {
   "title": "Wags & Walks partnership",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Wags &amp; Walks showcased real dogs up for adoption, with a focus on big dogs (or pups that will grow up to be big dogs) as they are often the most neglected. <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/kathrynhurley_/?hl=en\"><strong>Kathryn Hurley</strong></a>, founder of Wags &amp; Walks Nashville, anchored the afternoon as our host for the event. </p>"
    },
