  {
   "title": "Brad pitt appearance",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p><strong>Brad Pitt</strong> joined us along with the film’s on set Animal Coordinator, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Andrew_Simpson_(animal_trainer)\"><strong>Andrew Simpson</strong></a>, to share some words on the importance of big dog adoptions and pose with the pups looking for homes. </p>"
