  {
   "title": "Photo moments",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>An editorial-style portrait moment provided a space for guests to pose with their beloved pups. Guests immediately received their shot with a branded overlay to encourage social sharing. Additionally, a branded step &amp; repeat allowed guests and their dogs to pose and share on socials.</p>"
